# A bearing defect: impacts 87 times a second (an outer race's BPFO), each
# ringing the structure at 3 kHz, in noise. The time signal turns spiky
# (kurtosis well above noise's 3), the bearing band's RMS rises, and the
# envelope repeats at 87 Hz. Before it, noise alone: kurtosis 3.
@include tests/vib/setup.inc
vibsim0.noise = 0.05
run 1
vib0.kurt_x
vib0.env
vibsim0.brg_f = 87
vibsim0.brg_a = 3
run 1.5
vib0.kurt_x
vib0.env
vib0.env_f
@expect vib0.kurt_x[1] ~ 3 10%
@expect vib0.kurt_x[2] > 5
@expect vib0.env[2] > 0.15
@expect vib0.env_f ~ 87 1.5
